    "html": "<header class=\"hero-v2 text-color-white\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"herov2-content\"><div class=\"padding-section-large hero-v2\"><div class=\"text-align-center\"><div class=\"hero-content\"><h1 class=\"heading-style-h1\">Scale Your Law Firms Growth with Bright Ideas</h1><div class=\"spacer-small\"></div><p class=\"text-size-medium\">Stay Ahead Of Your Competitors! Most small to mid-size law firms are fed strategies that don’t work for them. We can help forge a path to bright ideas that are unique to you, work for you &amp; drive results for you.</p><div class=\"spacer-medium\"></div><div class=\"button-group\"><a href=\"https://brightideagroup.com/services\" class=\"button is-alternate w-button\">Explore Our Services</a><a href=\"https://brightideagroup.com/contact\" class=\"button is-secondary is-alternate w-button\">Schedule a Consultation</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"header33_background-video-wrapper\"><div class=\"video-overlay-layer v2\"></div><div class=\"header33_background-video w-background-video w-background-video-atom\"><video id=\"2721258e-337a-b293-f208-f20e114c7a14-video\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d2e55f019cfd81ac194694%2F68d34b329e7d930b90697226_a-lot-of-edison-old-fashion-bulbs-or-lamps-hanged-2025-08-28-14-45-38-utc%20%281440p%29-poster-00001.jpg&quot;)\"><source src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e9ad149fb2838ec812418c/68e9ad149fb2838ec81241e0_a-lot-of-edison-old-fashion-bulbs-or-lamps-hanged-2025-08-28-14-45-38-utc%20(1440p)-transcode.mp4\"><source src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e9ad149fb2838ec812418c/68e9ad149fb2838ec81241e0_a-lot-of-edison-old-fashion-bulbs-or-lamps-hanged-2025-08-28-14-45-38-utc%20(1440p)-transcode.webm\"></video></div></div></header>",
